---
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
import { files, glyphTotal, kb, meta, repo } from "../lib/data";
---

<section id="colophon" class="sec" aria-labelledby="colophon-h">
  <SectionHead id="colophon-h" title="Colophon" />
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="main cols">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Orderly is by Ossian Ravn, drawn in code with Claude. Each letter is a short Python function of a few numbers:
          the stem, the bar, the circle, how deeply a join is thinned. Six sets of those numbers make six masters, Thin,
          Regular and Black, each in a Text and a Display design, and the variable font runs between them.
        </p>
        <p>
          This page is set in Orderly and nothing else. Its numbers come from the same build that makes the font, and
          its drawings are the font's own outlines.
        </p>
        <p>
          The fonts are free to use, change and share under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The code that draws them, and
          this website, are under the MIT License.
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="links">
        <div>
          <dt class="label">Download</dt>
          {
            files.zip && (
              <dd>
                <a href={files.zip.href} download={files.zip.name}>Family, ZIP</a>
                <span class="size">{kb("downloads/orderly.zip")}</span>
              </dd>
            )
          }
          <dd>
            <a href={files.ttf.href} download={files.ttf.name}>Variable TTF</a>
            <span class="size">{kb("fonts/orderly-variable.ttf")}</span>
          </dd>
          <dd>
            <a href={files.woff2.href} download={files.woff2.name}>Web font, WOFF2</a>
            <span class="size">{kb("fonts/orderly.woff2")}</span>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="label">Source</dt>
          <dd><a href={repo}>github.com/ossianravn/orderly</a></dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="label">Licences</dt>
          <dd><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/OFL.txt`}>Fonts: SIL Open Font License 1.1</a></dd>
          <dd><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>Code and site: MIT</a></dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer class="foot grid">
    <p class="main label">Orderly {meta.version}, {glyphTotal} glyphs. Set in Orderly.</p>
  </footer>
</section>

<style>
  .sec {
    padding-top: var(--s7);
  }
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 32em) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--s5) var(--s6);
  }
  .links {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s4);
    align-content: start;
  }
  .links dt {
    margin-bottom: var(--s1);
  }
  .links dd + dd {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  /* Stacked links each get a 24 px touch target. */
  .links a {
    display: inline-block;
    min-height: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 0.1rem;
  }
  .size {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--f-small);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    margin-left: 0.3em;
  }
  .foot {
    margin-top: var(--s6);
  }
  .foot p {
    padding-top: var(--s3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
